:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83%E6%B4%BE%E5%AF%B9\" title=\"气球派对\"><img alt=\"气球派对\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83%E6%B4%BE%E5%AF%B9\" title=\"气球派对\">气球派对</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>黄粱一梦歌</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302403</div></div></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3c/Belonging-302404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">竹骨纸面筝<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bamboo Paper Kite</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.21<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>蝴蝶形状的风筝，比一阵风更轻的骨架和油纸制品，属于她独一无二的装饰，紧紧跟在她身后——孩子们喜欢这样。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/85/Belonging-302405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">饰银头冠<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Silver Headdress</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />77<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>雷山花纹银帽，西江形龙纹银翅，姑娘们应有的装饰。只要额外施加一点摇晃，流苏会飞溅出银光，银片也会发出悉窣的声音。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fd/Belonging-302406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">竹编花篓<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bamboo Flower Basket</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.17<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只装满草药的竹制花篓，归家时它就变得空空如也。草药的气味已渗透进竹篓的角落，所幸——所幸它并不苦，总有蝴蝶驻足于此。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 银翅谣1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A31.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 银翅谣2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E7%BF%85%E8%B0%A32.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-fil